<title>UK: ICO relists Colombian coffee prices.</title>
<headline>ICO relists Colombian coffee prices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Coffee Organization (ICO) on Monday requoted daily Colombian mild arabica coffee prices after Colombia reopened registrations for coffee sales.</p>
<p>The ICO stopped the Colombian price quotation in April following the closure of the registrations.</p>
<p>The price stood at 318.50 cents per lb on May 30. It was last quoted at 199.00 on April 21. -- Jalil Hamid, London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
</text>
